        proving, as <math|dom<around*|(|\<varepsilon\>|)>\<equallim\><rsub|<text|[eq:
        <reference|eq 16.320.128>]>>B<rsub|<around*|\<\|\|\>||\<\|\|\>><rsub|L<around*|(|X,X|)>>><around*|(|0,1|)>>,
        that

